{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"Hugo.Hugo.Extended","latestVersion":"0.169.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"The world’s fastest framework for building websites (with WebP encoding and Sass transpiling support)","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"The world’s fastest framework for building websites (with WebP encoding and Sass transpiling support)","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Hugo is one of the most popular open-source static site generators.\nWith its amazing speed and flexibility, Hugo makes building websites fun again.\nHugo is available in two flavors: standard and extended.\nWith the extended flavor you can:\n- Encode WebP images (decoding is also available in the standard build)\n- Transpile Sass to CSS using the embedded LibSass transpiler","name":"Hugo (Extended)","packageUrl":"https://gohugo.io/","publisher":"The Hugo Authors","publisherUrl":"https://gohugo.io/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo/releases/tag/v0.169.0","tags":["blog","blog-engine","cms","content-management-system","documentation","documentation-tool","static-site","static-site-generator"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"世界上最快的网站搭建框架（支持 WebP 编码和 Sass 转译）","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://gohugo.io/about/license","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Hugo 是最受欢迎的开源静态网站生成器之一。凭借其惊人的速度和灵活性，Hugo 让搭建网站又变得有趣起来。\nHugo 有两种版本：标准版和扩展版。在扩展版本中，您可以\n- 编码 WebP 图片（标准版也可以进行解码）\n- 使用内嵌的 LibSass 转译器将 Sass 转译为 CSS","name":"Hugo（扩展版）","packageUrl":"https://gohugo.io/","publisher":"The Hugo Authors","publisherUrl":"https://gohugo.io/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/gohugoio/hugo/releases/tag/v0.169.0","tags":["内容管理系统","博客","博客引擎","文档","文档工具","文档生成工具","静态网站","静态网站生成器"]}},"longDescription":"Hugo is one of the most popular open-source static site generato